sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant AO as Owner Agent
    participant AR as Requester Agent
    participant P as Provider / PRE Proxy
    participant S as Encrypted Store

    U->>AO: Configure Contact Policy and Data Sharing Policy
    AO->>S: Store C_i = Enc(DEK_i, data_i)
    AO->>S: Store EDEK_o_i bound to record_id and version
    AO->>P: Register metadata and Data Sharing Policy

    AR->>P: SAGA contact access request(owner_aid)
    P->>P: Evaluate owner Contact Policy
    P-->>AR: Contact authorization / OTK material
    AR->>AO: Establish SAGA contact session

    AR->>P: Data access request(record_id, class, purpose, version)
    P->>P: Verify requester signature and contact session
    P->>P: Evaluate Data Sharing Policy
    alt Policy allows
        P->>P: Issue data token and validate bindings
        P->>S: Fetch EDEK_o_i / transform input
        P->>P: PRE transform EDEK_o_i to EDEK_r_i
        P->>P: Write allow audit event
        P-->>AR: EDEK_r_i + ciphertext_ref + audit_id
        AR->>S: Fetch C_i
        AR->>AR: Decrypt DEK_i locally, then decrypt C_i
    else Policy denies
        P->>P: Write deny audit event
        P-->>AR: deny(reason, audit_id)
    end
